<title>JAPAN: Tsukishima Kikai -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tsukishima Kikai -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.01		vs	   26.81</p>
<p> Operating	    1.09		vs	  692    million</p>
<p> Current		1.29		vs	    1.11</p>
